959\">Unterstuetzen kann man den Podcast bei <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/retrokompott?ty=h\">PATREON</a><br />\n</span></span></div>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Die Links aus dem Podcast:</div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid9\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"\"><a href=\"http://www.amazon.de/Tobit-Software-Retrokompott/dp/B015Y7ZKPS/ref=sr_1_1?ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1447582819&amp;sr=8-1&amp;keywords=retrokompott\" target=\"_blank\">App nun auch bei Amazon</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid12\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid13\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/retrokompott\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"\">Unsere Patreon Seite:</span></a></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid23\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid24\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\" url\"><a href=\"http://www.bigfishgames.de/blog/hinter-den-kulissen-interview-mit-three-minute-games-den-entwicklern-von-lifeline/\">http://www.bigfishgames.de/blog/hinter-den-kulissen-interview-mit-three-minute-games-den-entwicklern-von-lifeline/</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid25\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid26\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\" url\"><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/thimbleweedpark/thimbleweed-park-a-new-classic-point-and-click-adv?lang=de\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/thimbleweedpark/thimbleweed-park-a-new-classic-point-and-click-adv?lang=de</a></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid44\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid45\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\" url\"><a href=\"http://retroism.com/\">http://retroism.com/<br />\n</a></span><span class=\"\"><br />\n</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid49\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align